==== ChanceToSpawnDamaged ====
Parameter for vehicle parts. The parameter sets a modifier for the chance of spawning a damaged part.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
ChanceToSpawnDamaged = 25,
</syntaxhighlight>

